SUMMARY:Jazz Art Writers South Festival Youth Exhibit
LOCATION:West Regional Library\, 5555 Grelot Road\, Mobile\, AL 36609
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday 9/15\n\nWest Regional Library hosts this youth exhibiti
 on tied to the Jazz Art Writers South Festival\, a partnership between Mob
 ile Arts Council and Amp Up Arts. More than 50 paintings by artists ages 8
  to 18 line the space\, each interpreting jazz through color and line. No 
 viewing hours are published for Tuesday\, September 15\, so call the libra
 ry to confirm.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleve
 ntures.com/events/ev-jazz-art-writers-south-festival-youth-exhibi-0915.htm
 l
