SUMMARY:Make It Last: Gallery Exhibition at UWF
LOCATION:UWF Center for Fine and Performing Arts\, Building 82\, The Art Ga
 llery\, 11000 University Parkway\, Pensacola\, FL 32514
DESCRIPTION:Weekdays through 11/20 · 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM · opening recept
 ion Thursday 10/8 · 5:00 PM to 7:00 PM\n\nMake It Last is an exhibition i
 n The Art Gallery at the UWF Center for Fine and Performing Arts\, curated
  by a UWF graduate. Six artists share the space\, which includes a convers
 ation pit in the gallery alcove and a poetry wall that visitors fill with 
 their own work. Admission is free\, and the opening reception on October 8
  runs from 5:00 PM to 7:00 PM.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastale
 ventures.com/events/ev-uwf-make-it-last-1001.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-uwf-make-it-last-1001.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
