SUMMARY:MONOCHROME exhibition
LOCATION:Blue Morning Gallery\, 21 S. Palafox Place\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/3 to Saturday 10/24 · times not posted\n\nMonochro
 me is a group show by three artists at Blue Morning Gallery\, 21 S. Palafo
 x Place in downtown Pensacola\, running through Saturday\, October 24. The
  black-and-white work asks what you notice\, such as shadow angles\, line 
 curves and surface grain. The First Friday reception was October 2 and has
  passed.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures
 .com/events/ev-monochrome-exhibition-1003.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-monochrome-exhibition-1003.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
