LOCATION:Valparaiso Library\, 459 Valparaiso Pkwy\, Valparaiso\, FL 32580
DESCRIPTION:Mon 10/5 to Fri 10/9 · 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nThe Valparaiso Li
 brary hosts Indios Amigos\, a traveling exhibit made by the Florida Public
  Archaeology Network and the UWF Archaeology Institute\, for Hispanic Heri
 tage Month. The library says this is the only Okaloosa County stop for the
  exhibit\, and it is open 9 AM to 5 PM through Friday\, October 9. The lis
 ting is for families and everyone.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails
 : https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-valparaiso-indios-amigos-exhibit-
