DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261005T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261005T170000
SUMMARY:Summer's End at Quayside Art Gallery
LOCATION:Quayside Art Gallery\, 17 E Zaragoza St\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Daily through 10/5 · 11:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nQuayside Art Galle
 ry in downtown Pensacola is showing Summer's End\, an exhibition about the
  turn from late summer into autumn\, through October 5. Four artists fill 
 the show with changing landscapes\, vacation memories and the amber light 
 of late summer evenings. The gallery is a locally owned artist co-op with 
 three floors of work by more than 50 local artists\, and it opens every da
 y from 11 AM to 5 PM.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-quayside-summers-end-2026.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-quayside-summers-end-2026.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
