 in Wonderland on the Mainstage in Building 82's Center for Fine and Perfor
 ming Arts\, open to the general public. The university's own calendar list
 s a price range of free up to $22\; no single admission figure is publishe
 d for this date. The run adds several more performances: October 3 at 7:30
  PM\, October 4 at 2:30 PM\, and October 9 at 7:30 PM. October 10 brings a
  10 AM show\, and the run closes with a matinee on October 11 at 2:30 PM. 
 Opening night is October 2 at 7:30 PM.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDet
