  the second Friday in November\, and it runs through December 23. More tha
 n 125 local artists and craftspeople sell pottery\, woodcarvings\, florals
 \, jewelry\, blown glass\, textiles\, soy candles\, wooden toys and orname
 nts on consignment. Admission is free.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://
 coastaleventures.com/events/ev-foley-art-center-trim-a-tree-1113.html
