LOCATION:Pensacola Museum of Art: Classroom\, 407 S Jefferson St.\, Pensaco
 la\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Tuesdays · 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM\n\nNext Generation Homeschool 
 Art is a visual arts course for ages 7 to 9 that follows National Visual A
 rts Standards. Group A meets Tuesday mornings from 10:00 AM to 12:00 PM at
  the Pensacola Museum of Art\, taught by Marce Wagner\, known as Ms. Messy
 . Term 1 runs August 25 through October 13 and costs $160 for museum membe
 rs or $180 for non-members. Three other weekday groups are available for d
 ifferent ages and schedules.\n\nPrice: from $180\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-next-generation-homeschool-art-tuesday-am-ag-082
 5.html
